              "id": "1775460679031_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given the following input data:\n{{$context.$variables.computedPanelData}}\n\nYour task is to summarize the data accurately and only from the provided input.\n\nReturn the following:\n1. Tier-wise total number of suppliers missing qualifications.\n2. Suppliers with non-expected outcomes.\n3. Total number of suppliers having adverse (not expected) outcomes.\n\nRules:\n- Use only the provided input data.\n- Do not hallucinate, infer, or use external knowledge.\n- Do not change the meaning of the data.\n- Count only what is explicitly supported by the input.\n- Keep the response brief, structured, and precise.\n- If any requested information is not present, state \"Not found in the provided data.\""
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
